{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08104","headline":"短歌行 · 李白","name":"短歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白日何短短，百年苦易满。\n苍穹浩茫茫，万劫太极长。\n麻姑垂两鬓，一半已成霜。\n天公见玉女，大笑亿千场。\n吾欲揽六龙，回车挂扶桑。\n北斗酌美酒，劝龙各一觞。\n富贵非所愿，与人驻颜光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}